&lt;li&gt;Build and sustain executive-level relationships with AVPs, VPs of advancement, and other senior stakeholders — deep enough to operate as a trusted advisor, not a vendor contact.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute account growth strategy for each partner: in close partnership with BD you are spotting expansion opportunities across product lines (online giving, events, volunteer management, platform capabilities), building the internal business case within the partner&#39;s org, and collaborating with BD on closing expansion.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain command of each account&#39;s org structure, budget cycle, political landscape, and current product footprint well enough to anticipate needs before they&#39;re raised.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
