&lt;li&gt;Build the case for, hire, and manage two junior-level Partner Success Associates once portfolio scope justifies it — delegating day-to-day product-line support so you can stay focused at the strategic and executive level.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report on account health, growth pipeline, and expansion forecasting to Partner Success leadership.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
