&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GiveCampus product mastery&lt;/strong&gt; — able to become a genuine expert across the platform (online giving, gift officer, events, volunteer management, platform capabilities), translate that into clear value for non-technical stakeholders, and hold their own in deeper technical conversations when needed&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account strategy and forecasting&lt;/strong&gt; — able to build and execute account growth plans, spot expansion opportunities across product lines, and report on pipeline/health metrics&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial/business-case building&lt;/strong&gt; — translating expansion opportunity into a structured internal business case a partner&#39;s finance or leadership team will actually approve&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive relationship-building&lt;/strong&gt; — building &quot;first-name, texting-basis&quot; trust with AVPs/VPs, not just quarterly-check-in rapport&lt;/li&gt;
